## Environment variables example

## Backend API URL (server-only; preferred for server-side fetches)
API_URL="https://rose-app.elevate-bootcamp.cloud/api"

## Backend API URL (client-side auth and other browser calls)
## If API_URL is unset, server-side code falls back to this value during local development.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL="https://rose-app.elevate-bootcamp.cloud/api"

## NextAuth
NEXTAUTH_URL="http://localhost:3000"
NEXTAUTH_SECRET="generate with: openssl rand -hex 32"
NEXTAUTH_SESSION_MAX_AGE=604800

## Stripe
## Publishable key for Stripe (public key)
NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=